## Philosophy

MARK is designed to **guide your best thinking**, not replace it. The AI agents provide structured workflows that extract your expertise and validate your decisions.

- **AI guides, you decide** - Structured processes help extract YOUR best marketing thinking
- **Human-in-the-loop always** - Manual handoffs by design
- **Adversarial review** - Critical evaluation before anything high-stakes goes live

